<title>GREECE: AFTER THE BELL - MAILLIS TRANSFERS TO MAIN MARKET.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - MAILLIS TRANSFERS TO MAIN MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said Maillis , a maker of steel tape used in packaging, will transfer to the bourse's main market effective on Monday.</p>
<p>Maillis with a total of 6,561,040 common bearer shares will be a main market listing in the industrial packaging sector, it said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
